<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS V AJAX TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS V AJAX TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the European Cup semifinal second leg match on Wednesday between Juventus of Italy and Ajax Amsterdam of the Netherlands (kickoff 1830 GMT):</p>
<p>Juventus: 1-Angelo Peruzzi; 2-Ciro Ferrara, 20-Alessio Tacchinardi, 4-Paolo Montero, 13-Mark Iuliano, 14-Didier Deschamps, 19-Attilio Lombardo, 7-Angelo Di Livio, 21-Zinedine Zidane, 9-Alen Boksic, 15-Christian Vieri.</p>
<p>Ajax: 1-Edwin Van der Sar, 4-Frank De Boer, 3-Danny Blind, 29-Mario Melchiot, 8-Richard Witschge, 5-Winston Bogarde, 19-Arnold Scholten, 10-Jari Litmanen, 11-Marc Overmars, 7-Tijani Babangida, 6-Ronald de Boer.</p>
<p>Referee: Kim Nielsen (Denmark).</p>
